@11000 = "Enough! Hahaha... You bite harder than the rest of the worms who dared crawl into my lair. I had hoped to crush you quickly, but perhaps... perhaps there's some entertainment to be wrung from your twitching carcasses after all."

@11001 = "Let us play a little game, you and I. I'll give you a head start. Try not to die too quickly—it spoils the fun."

@11002 = "Incredible... You actually crawled your way back to me. Bruised, bloodied, and yet still defiant. It's almost adorable. But even vermin can scurry through corpses if the path is wide enough. Now let me show you why nothing leaves this lair unbroken."